<title>FRANCE: Credit Agricole ups Suez stake to 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Credit Agricole ups Suez stake to 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse Nationale du Credit Agricole said on Friday it now holds seven percent of Suez shares and has eight percent of the voting rights.</p>
<p>&quot;The Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole has increased its stake in Suez capital to seven percent of the shares and eight percent of the voting rights, making it one of the main shareholders,&quot; Credit Agricole chairman Lucien Douroux said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
